=S[540]},{id="professions",x=S[561]},{id="crafting",x=S[549]},{id="questgear",x=S[531]},{id=S[483],x=S[702]}},asideNote=S[68],talentString="053303102000000005303031005101225102",ranks={{tree="Elemental",name="Concussion",r=5,max=5},{tree="Elemental",name="Elemental Devastation",r=3,max=3},{tree="Elemental",name="Reverberation",r=2,max=5},{tree="Elemental",name=S[879],r=1,max=1},{tree="Enhancement",name=S[611],r=5,max=5},{tree="Enhancement",name=S[593],r=3,max=5},{tree="Enhancement",name="Mental Dexterity",r=3,max=3},{tree="Enhancement",name="Elemental Weapons",r=3,max=3},{tree="Enhancement",name="Shamanistic Focus",r=1,max=1},{tree="Enhancement",name="Flurry",r=5,max=5},{tree="Enhancement",name="Stormstrike",r=1,max=1},{tree="Enhancement",name="Spirit Weapons",r=1,max=1},{tree="Enhancement",name="Mental Quickness",r=2,max=2},{tree="Enhancement",name="Improved Stormstrike",r=2,max=2},{tree="Enhancement",name=S[861],r=5,max=5},{tree="Enhancement",name=S[595],r=1,max=1},{tree="Restoration",name="Tidal Focus",r=5,max=5},{tree="Restoration",name="Mindfulness",r=3,max=3}},order={},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[532]},{t="p",s="legend",x="|cff71d5ffBlue text was updated for the WoW Forever hotfixes up to 10 November and is awaiting final review.|r"},{t="h1",x="Enhancement",sub=S[612]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Turn melee uptime into Maelstrom-powered Lightning Bolts, use Stormstrike deliberately, and support the group with well-placed totems."},{t="pills",list={S[539],S[562]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[768]},{t="h2",x=S[452]},{t="p",x=S[66]},{t="p",s="level",x="1–19 · Weapon and mana foundations"},{t="p",x="Keep your weapon skill and trained ranks current. Pull with Lightning Bolt when distance allows, then let melee swings finish economical kills. Heal between pulls before committing to another enemy. Begin the Enhancement investment toward your melee and Intellect synergies; reserve mana for a heal or an interrupt."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Build the melee engine"},{t="p",x="Develop Shamanistic Focus, Stormstrike and Flurry as their gates open. Ghost Wolf stays a travel tool: no PvE Shaman build takes Improved Ghost Wolf. Set useful totems for durable fights, relocate them as the fight moves, and avoid spending a full setup on every short-lived target."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Finish the hybrid"},{t="p",x="Complete Maelstrom Weapon and Rage of the Farseer, then finish the selected Elemental and Restoration support. Mail becomes available at 40; compare stats rather than replacing every leather piece immediately. Keep a separate healing set if you intend to cover dungeon healing."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[485]},{t="h2",x=S[539]},{t="p",x="Tree order: Elemental / Enhancement / Restoration. These 51 points are entered on the Standards.gg talent calculator and checked against the launch talent trees for totals, maximum ranks, tier gates and prerequisites. Changes made inside the calculator do not rewrite this guide. Start with 5/5 Tidal Focus and 3/3 Mindfulness for mana while you level. Once you have enough gear, move those points into 3/3 Call of Flame and 2/2 Trial by Fire, keeping 2/5 Tidal Focus (one more point goes into Reverberation to unlock Trial by Fire): ."},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[541]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="p",s="notice",x="This build is 11 / 32 / 8: it takes Spirit Weapons but not Improved Ghost Wolf, Water Shield or Lightning Mastery, favoring melee damage and mana support over utility."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[613]},{t="h2",x=S[509]},{t="p",x="Weapon damage per second is always your best stat. |cff71d5ffCollect Strength and attack power gear as you level.|r Enhancement mixes melee and spells, and |cff71d5ffMental Dexterity (33% / 66% / 100% of your Intellect as attack power)|r and Mental Quickness turn Intellect into attack power and spell damage, |cff71d5ffbut Intellect is secondary to Strength and attack power.|r"},{t="h3",x=S[734]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[911],x="a slow two-hander"},{t="stat",i=2,b="Strength",x="attack power"},{t="stat",i=3,b="Intellect",x="attack power and spell damage through talents"},{t="stat",i=4,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b="Agility",x="crit and armor"},{t="p",s="small",x="Use slow two-handed weapons, around 3.3 speed or slower: Stormstrike and Windfury Weapon hit harder with slow weapons."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[911],x=""},{t="stat",i=2,b="Hit chance",x="to 8%, more helps your spells"},{t="stat",i=3,b="Expertise",x="to 6.5%"},{t="stat",i=4,b=S[703],x="also keeps Flurry up"},{t="stat",i=5,b="Strength",x=""},{t="stat",i=6,b="Intellect",x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Hit above 8% still helps because many of your attacks are spells (spell cap 17%). |cff71d5ffFavor Strength and attack power; Intellect is secondary because Mental Dexterity gives less attack power.|r"},{t="p",s="notice",x="Melee hit cap: 8% for special attacks against raid bosses. Expertise removes dodge at 6.5% and parry at 14% (parry only matters from the front). The level 60 list is an early estimate: the beta stopped at level 30, so expect changes once endgame gear is known. A big upgrade in a lower stat can still beat a small one in a higher stat."},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[510]},{t="h2",x=S[550]},{t="p",x=S[81]},{t="h4",x="Prepare weapon, shield and space"},{t="p",x="Keep a suitable weapon imbue active and maintain Lightning Shield when its damage will be used. Windfury Weapon is an option once trained. Spirit Weapons is selected, so you gain its parry chance and lower melee threat. Let the tank establish control before committing burst."},{t="h4",x="Keep melee contact and use Stormstrike"},{t="p",x="Position behind a tanked target where practical. |cff71d5ffStormstrike hits for 100% weapon damage on an 8-second cooldown,|r so press it whenever it is ready, then spend its damage benefit with Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Earth Shock as the situation warrants. Avoid chasing a fleeing enemy into another pack just to preserve a swing."},{t="h4",x="Spend Maelstrom on Lightning Bolt"},{t="p",x="Read the charges before casting. |cff71d5ffEvery stack takes 20% off the cast time and Mana cost at all ranks, so five stacks support an instant, mana-free Lightning Bolt; the rank only changes how often it procs (6, 7, 8, 9 or 10 times a minute at ranks 1 to 5).|r The documented effect is for Lightning Bolt; do not assume it grants instant heals or Chain Lightning. A hard cast in melee can cost swings and expose you to pushback."},{t="h4",x="Choose shocks and fire damage deliberately"},{t="p",x="Earth Shock supplies an interrupt as well as damage; reserve it for a dangerous cast when needed. Flame Shock needs enough target life to pay back. For a safe pack, place a fire totem and use Fire Nova around its location. Keep area damage away from controlled enemies."},{t="h4",x="Use burst and recovery before trouble"},{t="p",x="Activate Rage of the Farseer when you can stay in melee. Heal, cleanse or use a defensive utility totem when that prevents a death. Improved Stormstrike and Mindfulness help sustain, but do not justify pulling indefinitely with no mana reserve."},{t="abil",names={"Stormstrike",S[898],S[861],"Earth Shock","Fire Nova",S[595]}},{t="h3",x=S[646]},{t="p",x="Weapon damage matters to melee attacks. Compare Strength, Agility, attack power, useful hit, Intellect and adequate Stamina. Your selected Mental Dexterity and Mental Quickness make Intellect useful beyond the mana pool. Check the target and attack type before treating any hit value as a universal cap."},{t="p",x=S[64]},{t="h3",x=S[504]},{t="p",x=S[56]},{t="p",x=S[52]},{t="p",x=S[124]},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[614]},{t="h2",x=S[424]},{t="p",x=S[59]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[40]},{t="macro",n=S[551],x=S[126],code=S[201]},{t="macro",n=S[583],x=S[120],code=S[175]},{t="macro",n=S[594],x=S[113],code=S[199]},{t="macro",n=S[704],x=S[122],code=S[266]},{t="macro",n=S[563],x=S[121],code=S[230]},{t="macro",n=S[564],x=S[155],code=S[207]},{t="macro",n=S[552],x=S[247],code=S[202]},{t="macro",n=S[542],x=S[158],code=S[179]},{t="macro",n=S[565],x=S[94],code=S[173]},{t="macro",n=S[505],x=S[129],code=S[267]},{t="macro",n=S[615],x=S[160],code=S[342]},{t="macro",n=S[469],x=S[115],code=S[225]},{t="macro",n="Stormstrike and auto-attack",x="Start melee swings on your living hostile target and attempt Stormstrike. Auto-attacks can begin even when Stormstrike is on cooldown; requires your selected talent.",code="#showtooltip Stormstrike\n/startattack [harm,nodead]\n/cast [harm,nodead] Stormstrike"},{t="macro",n=S[595],x="Activate your selected melee cooldown and start attacking your hostile target. Use it when you can remain in range.",code="#showtooltip Rage of the Farseer\n/startattack [harm,nodead]\n/cast Rage of the Farseer"},{t="macro",n="Refresh Lightning Shield",x="Refresh your damage shield. Your supplied build does not learn Water Shield, so that spell is not put on this button.",code="#showtooltip Lightning Shield\n/cast Lightning Shield"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[256]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[705]},{t="h2",x=S[474]},{t="p",x=S[60]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[46]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[74]},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[511]},{t="h2",x=S[470]},{t="p",x=S[61]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[543]},{t="h2",x=S[453]},{t="p",x=S[37]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[512]},{t="h2",x=S[420]},{t="p",x=S[41]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[483]},{t="kicker",x=S[706]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[91]}}},{id="restoration",name="Restoration",token="RESTO",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the quest giver and the faction. Quest leve